(text "TVP7002 on 3.3 V IOVDD. The H417 VIO18 rail MUST be 3.3 V (Maker go R39 fitted 0R, or firmware\nPWR_CTLR VIO18=3.3V) before RESETB is released: TVP IOVDD is 3.3 V and the VIO18 pins are not\n5V/over-voltage tolerant." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8da1b95f-8dbd-5005-98af-9dc36616fdde"))
(text "Sync comes from SOGIN (composite or luma; the PS1 has no sync pin), so the digital HSYNC/VSYNC\ninputs are grounded as unused. I2C address B8h (I2CA low)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 203 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8847183c-916e-5a83-8546-e4be0d2c4478"))
