(text "Control. RESETB is held low by 2.2k until the CH32H417 releases it (TVP_RESETn is an MCU GPIO, PA4),\nso the TVP7002 stays in reset until firmware is up (SLES206C: no I2C activity before reset\ncompletes). PWDN 2.2k to GND (Figure 8). I2C bus: 2.2k pull-ups to +3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 179.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "72b50672-9092-5bbc-a9dd-1edb44877f6d"))
